            "question": "What does my 30-day risk free return include?",
            "answer": "<p>We want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase. If for any reason the customer wishes to return an item, you may do so within 30 days of the delivery date. <br/>Errors in ordering, sizing issues, financing, cancellations/requests to cancel and changes in circumstances are not part of the sleep trial and will void your refund eligibility.</p>"
